        <itemfeedback ident="correct_fb">
          <flow_mat>
            <material>
              <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://psychology.about.com/od/profilesofmajorthinkers/p/bio_erikson.htm"&gt;Erikson&lt;/a&gt; believed that people face some sort of developmental conflict at each stage of development. Successfully mastering the conflict leads to the development of psychological virtues that contribute to future growth. Failing to resolve a conflict during any stage can lead to problems that will plague the individual for a lifetime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
            </material>
